Meta.ContainerPolicy=SupportedOnWindows, RecommendedOnLinux
Meta.ContainerPolicyReason=All server binaries are Windows .exe files; Wine (ideally latest stable from winehq.org) is required on Linux. A container avoids installing Wine on the host.
